+# tldr attribution
+
+The tldr-pages team and contributors created the upstream reference pages:
+https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/tree/eacda7020c4102729187c38c35ce28fac00365c9
+
+Page content is licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
+(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ . The upstream
+LICENSE.md must accompany the snapshot, separately from nl-shell's Apache-2.0
+code license.
+
+Selection/repackaging: only English pages/common/ and pages/linux/ Markdown
+pages are included, sorted and repackaged as path/content JSONL with original
+text and placeholders unchanged. This does not include upstream executable
+scripts and does not imply upstream endorsement of nl-shell.
